        #      2) headerIn (container)
        #         - Mode 0/1: [axUserId, descr, currencyCode, exchRate, projId]
        #         - Mode 2  : at least [axUserId] (other fields ignored)
        #      3) linesIn (container of line containers)
        #         - Each line: [transDateStr, typeValue, lineDescr, internacional, ticket, qty, amount, lineProjId, attachFiles]
        #      4) optionsIn (optional container): [mode, existingHojaGastosId]
        #         - mode: 0|1|2
        #         - existingHojaGastosId required if mode == 2
        #*/
